{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:7157","original":"A character from [[Neon Genesis Evangelion]], daughter of [[Souryuu Kyouko Zeppelin]].\r\n\r\nShe is a 14-year-old of mixed German and Japanese descent, and American by nationality. The red hot pilot of [[Eva 02]], she is proud in nature and a tough girl with attitude. She is described as being [[tsundere]] for [[Ikari Shinji]] and the two may be considered a canon pairing as director [[Anno Hideaki]] has stated to prefer the two of them together. \r\n\r\nSee {{Souryuu_Asuka_Langley Rebuild_of_Evangelion}} for Shikinami Asuka Langley from the [[Rebuild of Evangelion]] movies.\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !asset #50127246\r\n* !asset #50127250\r\n* !post #466939: [[Plugsuit (evangelion)|]] [br] [[Neon Genesis Evangelion]]\r\n* !asset #50127232: [[Test plugsuit (evangelion)|]] [br] [[Evangelion: 2.0 You Can (Not) Advance]]\r\n* !asset #50127237: [[Evangelion: 3.0 You Can (Not) Redo]]\r\n* !asset #50127238: [[Evangelion: 3.0+1.0 Thrice Upon A Time]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[ANTA BAKA?]] (Asuka's catchphrase)\r\n* [[Feliz Jueves (meme)]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Evangelion Wiki: Asuka Langley Sohryu\":https://evangelion.fandom.com/wiki/Asuka_Langley_Sohryu\r\n* \"Evangelion Wiki: Asuka Shikinami Langley\":https://evangelion.fandom.com/wiki/Asuka_Shikinami_Langley","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"souryuu_asuka_langley"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:475833","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668